                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">aulas</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-[#f0f7f2] rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-center">
                <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#123A2B]">∞</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">updates</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Módulos -->
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 text-base mt-1">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#123A2B]/10 bg-[#f0f7f2]/40">
                <span class="text-[#CA7B50] font-bold text-xs font-mono">M1</span>
                <span>Estilo de vida e custo</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#123A2B]/10 bg-[#f0f7f2]/40">
                <span class="text-[#CA7B50] font-bold text-xs font-mono">M2</span>
                <span>Finanças para viajar</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#123A2B]/10 bg-[#f0f7f2]/40">
                <span class="text-[#CA7B50] font-bold text-xs font-mono">M3</span>
                <span>Trabalhos remotos</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#123A2B]/10 bg-[#f0f7f2]/40">
                <span class="text-[#CA7B50] font-bold text-xs font-mono">M4</span>
                <span>Rendas na estrada</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#123A2B]/10 bg-[#f0f7f2]/40">
                <span class="text-[#CA7B50] font-bold text-xs font-mono">M5</span>
                <span>Trocas e voluntariado</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#123A2B]/10 bg-[#f0f7f2]/40">
                <span class="text-[#CA7B50] font-bold text-xs font-mono">M6</span>
                <span>Plano de ação</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Bloco 3 — Como funciona -->
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#123A2B] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">03</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif text-[#123A2B] leading-snug">
              Como funciona
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 text-base">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#4A7C5F] mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
                <span>Acesso imediato após pagamento</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#4A7C5F] mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
                <span>Plataforma online — sem instalar nada</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#4A7C5F] mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
                <span>Funciona no celular e no computador</span>
              </li>
